<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#F4F6F9', fontFamily: 'PingFang SC', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>

  <Box style={{ height: 88, background: '#1F3A6E', padding: '0 40px', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 25, fontWeight: '600', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>科技温度计周报｜市场情绪监测</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.75)', marginTop: 5 }}>信号源：科技温度计　|　标的：产业趋势组合（模拟）　|　数据截至 2026-09-22</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.85)' }}>2026 年第 39 周</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ padding: '14px 40px 0' }}>
    <Box style={{ display: 'flex', gap: 14, height: 86 }}>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E5E8EE', borderRadius: 12, padding: '12px 20px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#7B8494' }}>当前温度计读数（09-22）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: '600', color: '#2F6FED', marginTop: 2 }}>41.8°</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E5E8EE', borderRadius: 12, padding: '12px 20px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#7B8494' }}>上周五读数（09-18）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: '600', color: '#4A5464', marginTop: 2 }}>40.4°</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFF7F7', border: '1px solid #F2D4D4', borderRadius: 12, padding: '12px 20px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#7B8494' }}>边际变化（较上周五）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: '600', color: '#D93636', marginTop: 2 }}>+1.4° ↑ 回升</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1.15, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E5E8EE', borderRadius: 12, padding: '12px 20px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#7B8494' }}>所处区间（40° 为低温阈值）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: '600', color: '#1A1D26', marginTop: 8 }}>已回升至 40° 上方，脱离低温触发区</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11.5, color: '#9AA3B2', marginTop: 2 }}>上周五尚在触发区边缘（40.4°）</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E5E8EE', borderRadius: 12, padding: '10px 12px', display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Image src="assets/p1_temp_tmt.png" style={{ width: 1046, height: 417 }} />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 8, background: '#EFF4FE', borderRadius: 10, padding: '9px 18px' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#1A1D26', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontWeight: '600', color: '#1F3A6E' }}>本周解读：</Text>温度计较上周五回升 1.4°，主要由「上涨股票占比」（18.8→26.1，+7.3pt）与「250日月跌幅均指滚动百分位」（29.7→34.9，+5.2pt）两项因子得分修复驱动，行业拥挤度（77.1→72.6，−4.5pt）回落形成部分对冲。温度计为 10 因子等权合成，周内对比区间 2026-09-18 → 2026-09-22。
      </Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, right: 0, bottom: 0, height: 30, background: '#1F3A6E', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'flex-end', padding: '0 40px' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.8)' }}>01 / 02</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
